			"opacity": 100,
			"angle": 0,
			"text": "• Stocke TOUT le contenu\n  (PDFs, .md, scans, mappings)\n• Versionne tout\n• Gère le offline (clone local)\n• Authentifie les push (SSH/HTTPS)\n• Hook pre-receive = permissions\n• Hook post-receive = indexation",
